// mw2coop console texts: what the developer console (the ` / ~ key) prints and shows, in the .str format of the Call of Duty
// engines (the same as the game's own localizedstrings). Edit a line and restart the game; a text you delete keeps the
// mod's built-in wording. UTF-8. %s and %d in a text are filled in by the console: keep them in the same order.
VERSION             "1"
CONFIG              "mw2coop"
FILENOTES           ""

REFERENCE           CON_FIND_USAGE
LANG_ENGLISH        "find <text>: the commands and dvars with that in their name"
LANG_RUSSIAN        "find <текст>: команды и переменные, в именах которых встречается этот текст"

REFERENCE           CON_SVCHEATS_NOT_REGISTERED
LANG_ENGLISH        "sv_cheats is not registered yet; the value was not changed."
LANG_RUSSIAN        "sv_cheats ещё не зарегистрирован; значение не изменено."

REFERENCE           CON_SVCHEATS_BAD_TYPE
LANG_ENGLISH        "sv_cheats has an unexpected type; the value was not changed."
LANG_RUSSIAN        "У sv_cheats неожиданный тип; значение не изменено."

